<section class="index"><h1>Snapfire FSR</h1><p>The advanced example: plans built in Rust, Tera rendering, React islands and no JavaScript engine on the server.</p><ul><li><a href="/dash/servers">/dash/servers</a> eager render, a cached page segment and an island hydrated on load</li><li><a href="/slow/servers">/slow/servers</a> a deferred segment that streams in, with an island hydrated when it becomes visible</li><li><a href="/dash/down">/dash/down</a> a failing backend degrading one segment instead of the page</li><li><a href="/login">/login</a> the dev login flow</li></ul><p class="creds">Dev sign in: <code>alice</code> / <code>wonder</code> or <code>bob</code> / <code>builder</code>.</p></section>
